# Lure of the Wildcat (San d'Oria) (sandoria 113): the guard xi.settings.main.ENABLE_TOAU == 1 with the setting a boolean:
# Lua's `true == 1` is false: not offered, Amutiyaal's own script (816). A port that reads true as 1 (Settings.MainNumber /
# Main) would offer it; Settings.MainEquals (quest rework P9) does not. Then 1: 812 (its finish gives the badge and begins
# it). Recorded on Lua at 0988c0cb^ (the parent of the commit that deleted the Lua).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amutiyaal/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/812
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=118.0,0.0,84.7 job=WAR lvl=20
setting ENABLE_TOAU true
login
trigger Amutiyaal                         # ENABLE_TOAU true: not offered; 816
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1
trigger Amutiyaal                         # ENABLE_TOAU 1: 812
finish                                    # the Red Sentinel Badge; begun
